        },
        {
          "text": "“I nino dwe apar wiye abic me dwe me abiro wubibedo ki gurre maleŋ; pe wuti iye tic mo matek. Wubikwero nino madito me woro Rwot pi nino abiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubityero gitum awaŋa i nino man mukwoŋo-ni, gityer ma giwaŋo ki mac wek obed gin ma ŋwece kur me yomo cwiny Rwot: litino twoni apar wiye adek, nyogi romi aryo ki litino nyogi romi apar wiye aŋwen ma ditogi mwaka acel acel; gubed ma komgi pe ki mwonyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubimiyo gityer me moko kwon mutikogi, moko mapwotte ma girubo ki moo ma romo agwata adek pi twoni apar wiye adek ki acel acel, agwata aryo pi nyogi romi aryo pi acel acel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ki agwata acel pi litino romi apar wiye aŋwen pi acel acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
